List all plugins that are currently active in the engine.

  Plugins are the unit of capability delivery. Each plugin registers
  one or more capabilities when it activates. If no plugins are active,
  the capability registry will be empty and no steps can execute.

  Plugins are loaded from the JAR files listed under "plugins" in
  nexora.json, via engine.loadPlugin(), or wired programmatically in
  your application code.

  Subcommands
  ───────────
    reload    Swap a plugin for a new JAR inside a running
              `nexora observe` server, without a restart.

  Examples
  ────────
    nexora plugins
    nexora --config /etc/nexora/prod.json plugins
    nexora plugins reload payments --jar /opt/nexora/plugins/payments-1.3.0.jar
